\n } catch (InterruptedException e) {\n Ln.w(\"Interrupted while waiting for image\", e);\n Thread.currentThread().interrupt();\n return null;\n } finally {\n imageLatch = null;\n }\n }"}","mcp_server_name":"","mcp_tool_name":""}},{"id":2,"type":0,"content":"确实如你所说！问题在于 ImageReader 需要时间来捕获第一帧图像。从代码中可以看到：

