", e);\n return \"ERROR \" + e.getMessage();\n }\n }\n\n @Override\n public String getHelp() {\n return \"Get screenshot bitmap without saving to file\";\n }\n}", "old_str_start_line_number": 1, "old_str_end_line_number": 62, "new_str": "package com.github.kirer.adb.commands;\n\nimport android.graphics.Bitmap;\nimport com.genymobile.scrcpy.util.Ln;\nimport com.github.kirer.adb.net.CommandResult;\nimport com.github.kirer.adb.net.ExtendedServiceCommand;\nimport com.github.kirer.adb.screenshot.ScreenshotService;\n\n/**\n * Bitmap\u83b7\u53d6\u547d\u4ee4 - \u83b7\u53d6bitmap\u5bf9\u8c61\uff0c\u652f\u6301\u8fd4\u56de\u5b9e\u9645\u7684Bitmap\u5bf9\u8c61\n */\npublic class BitmapCommand implements ExtendedServiceCommand {\n private final ScreenshotService screenshotService;\n\n public BitmapCommand(ScreenshotService screenshotService) {\n this.screenshotService = screenshotService;\n }\n\n @Override\n public String getCommandName() {\n return \"bitmap\";\n }\n\n @Override\n public CommandResult executeExtended(String[] params) {\n try {\n // \u68c0\u67e5\u670d\u52a1\u72b6\u6001\n if (!screenshotService.isRunning()) {\n return CommandResult.error(\"Screenshot service is not running\");\n }\n \n long startTime = System.currentTimeMillis();\n \n // \u83b7\u53d6bitmap\n Bitmap bitmap = screenshotService.takeScreenshot();\n \n long duration = System.currentTimeMillis() - startTime;\n \n if (bitmap != null) {\n int width = bitmap.getWidth();\n int height = bitmap.getHeight();\n \n String message = \"Bitmap captured in \" + duration + \"ms, size: \" + width + \"x\" + height;\n \n // \u8fd4\u56de\u5305\u542bBitmap\u5bf9\u8c61\u7684\u7ed3\u679c\n return CommandResult.bitmap(bitmap, message);\n } else {\n return CommandResult.error(\"Failed to capture bitmap after \" + duration + \"ms\");\n }\n \n } catch (Exception e) {\n Ln.e(\"Error executing bitmap command\", e);\n return CommandResult.error(e.getMessage());\n }\n }\n\n @Override\n public String getHelp() {\n return \"Get screenshot bitmap object (can return actual Bitmap or string response)\";\n }\n}"}","mcp_server_name":"","mcp_tool_name":""}},{"id":2,"type":0,"content":"现在修改 `BitmapCommand` 来实现新的接口并返回 `Bitmap` 对象：
