put path\");\n }\n \n return saveToFileResult(outputPath);\n }\n\n } catch (Exception e) {\n Ln.e(\"Error executing screenshot command\", e);\n return CommandResult.error(e.getMessage());\n }\n }\n \n /**\n * \u83b7\u53d6bitmap\u5e76\u8fd4\u56de\u5b57\u8282\u6570\u7ec4\u7ed3\u679c\n */\n private CommandResult getBitmapResult() {\n long startTime = System.currentTimeMillis();\n \n // \u83b7\u53d6bitmap\n Bitmap bitmap = screenshotService.takeScreenshot();\n \n long duration = System.currentTimeMillis() - startTime;\n \n if (bitmap != null) {\n int width = bitmap.getWidth();\n int height = bitmap.getHeight();\n \n String message = \"Bitmap captured in \" + duration + \"ms, size: \" + width + \"x\" + height;\n \n // \u8fd4\u56de\u5305\u542bBitmap\u5bf9\u8c61\u7684\u7ed3\u679c\n return CommandResult.bitmap(bitmap, message);\n } else {\n return CommandResult.error(\"Failed to capture bitmap after \" + duration + \"ms\");\n }\n }\n \n /**\n * \u4fdd\u5b58\u5230\u6587\u4ef6\u5e76\u8fd4\u56de\u7ed3\u679c\n */\n private CommandResult saveToFileResult(String outputPath) {\n // \u6267\u884c\u622a\u56fe\u4fdd\u5b58\n boolean success = screenshotService.saveScreenshotSafe(outputPath);\n \n if (success) {\n return CommandResult.success(\"Screenshot saved to \" + outputPath);\n } else {\n return CommandResult.error(\"Failed to capture or save screenshot\");\n }\n }"}","mcp_server_name":"","mcp_tool_name":""}},{"id":2,"type":0,"content":""},{"id":3,"type":2,"content":""},{"id":4,"type":3,"content":""}],"seen_state":"seen","structured_request_nodes":[{"id":1,"type":1,"tool_result_node":{"content":"Successfully edited the file server-adb-shell/src/main/java/com/github/kirer/adb/commands/ScreenshotCommand.java.
