" public synchronized Image waitForImage(long timeoutMs) {\n CountDownLatch latch = null;\n try {\n Ln.i(\"=== waitForImage() called with timeout: \" + timeoutMs + \"ms ===\");\n \n // \u5982\u679c\u5df2\u7ecf\u6709\u56fe\u50cf\uff0c\u76f4\u63a5\u8fd4\u56de\n Image existing = latestImage.get();\n if (existing != null) {\n try {\n existing.getWidth(); // \u68c0\u67e5\u662f\u5426\u5df2\u5173\u95ed\n Ln.d(\"Found existing valid image\");\n return existing;\n } catch (IllegalStateException e) {\n Ln.d(\"Existing image is closed, clearing reference\");\n latestImage.set(null);\n }\n }\n\n // \u521b\u5efa\u7b49\u5f85\u9501\n latch = new CountDownLatch(1);\n imageLatch = latch;\n Ln.d(\"Created new CountDownLatch, waiting for image...\");\n\n // \u7b49\u5f85\u56fe\u50cf\u53ef\u7528\n boolean received = latch.await(timeoutMs, java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS);\n Ln.d(\"Wait result: \" + received);\n\n if (received) {\n Image image = latestImage.get();\n if (image != null) {\n try {\n image.getWidth(); // \u68c0\u67e5\u662f\u5426\u5df2\u5173\u95ed\n Ln.d(\"Image received after waiting\");\n return image;\n } catch (IllegalStateException e) {\n Ln.w(\"Received image is already closed\");\n latestImage.set(null);\n return null;\n }\n } else {\n Ln.w(\"Image latch signaled but no image available\");\n return null;\n }\n } else {\n Ln.w(\"Timeout waiting for image after \" + timeoutMs + \"ms\");\n return null;\n }\n } catch (InterruptedException e) {\n Ln.w(\"Interrupted while waiting for image\", e);\n Thread.currentThread().interrupt();\n return null;\n } catch (Exception e) {\n Ln.e(\"Exception in waitForImage()\", e);\n return null;\n } finally {\n // \u53ea\u6e05\u9664\u6211\u4eec\u521b\u5efa\u7684latch\n if (imageLatch == latch) {\n imageLatch = null;\n }\n Ln.i(\"=== waitForImage() finished ===\");\n }\n }"}","mcp_server_name":"","mcp_tool_name":""}},{"id":2,"type":0,"content":"问题可能在于 `imageLatch` 的并发访问。当一个线程在等待时，另一个线程可能已经将 `imageLatch` 设置为 `null`。

